WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Start with existing work, references and the director’s notes.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.400
Define usable design rules. Review representative samples with the director.

00:08.400 --> 00:12.400
Share a project pack containing rules, samples and delivery requirements.

00:12.400 --> 00:17.200
Describe the task. Create from the same rules, references and project version.

00:17.200 --> 00:21.000
Review against the rules, explain revisions and feed shared issues back.

00:21.000 --> 00:24.000
One team, one visual memory. Install the Skill and start in your agent.
